{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-footprint","title":"数字足迹分析","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/digital-footprint","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"domain-infrastructure","title":"域名与基础设施侦察","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/digital-footprint/domain-infrastructure","wordCount":2520,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-intelligence","title":"社交媒体情报分析","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/digital-footprint/social-media-intelligence","wordCount":2443,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"dark-web-monitoring","title":"暗网监控与情报采集","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/digital-footprint/dark-web-monitoring","wordCount":2181,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 数字足迹分析\n\n本章聚焦对目标组织或个人数字足迹的深度分析。数字足迹是目标在互联网上有意或无意留下的所有可追踪信息痕迹。内容覆盖三大核心方向：域名与基础设施侦察（DNS、WHOIS、证书透明度日志）、社交媒体情报分析（SOCMINT）以及暗网监控与情报采集。通过系统化的数字足迹分析，安全团队能够全面评估目标的信息暴露面，发现潜在的安全风险点。\n"}